WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,580
Brother Wang

2
00:00:01,580 --> 00:00:02,580
How did you find this place?

3
00:00:02,580 --> 00:00:03,580
Passing by for shopping

4
00:00:03,580 --> 00:00:04,580
I happened to see your car

5
00:00:04,580 --> 00:00:05,580
Just come in and take a look

6
00:00:05,580 --> 00:00:06,580
I didn’t expect it was really you

7
00:00:07,580 --> 00:00:08,580
That came just in time

8
00:00:08,580 --> 00:00:09,580
If you don’t mind, let’s eat some together.

9
00:00:10,580 --> 00:00:11,580
This is my daughter Linshiyu

10
00:00:11,580 --> 00:00:12,580
little song fish

11
00:00:12,580 --> 00:00:15,930
The fish called Uncle Wang so blind

12
00:00:16,930 --> 00:00:17,930
How about Brother Wang?

13
00:00:17,930 --> 00:00:29,090
This stuff doesn't taste good elsewhere, bro.

14
00:00:29,090 --> 00:00:30,090
Where did you get this stupid thing from?

15
00:00:30,090 --> 00:00:33,210
I have a friend who does salvage at sea

16
00:00:33,210 --> 00:00:34,210
He only makes good goods

17
00:00:34,210 --> 00:00:36,210
The ship was basically booked before it even docked.

18
00:00:36,210 --> 00:00:38,210
I installed this batch

19
00:00:38,210 --> 00:00:41,210
I specifically asked him to come and test sell this batch.
